matt-pocock-skills (Kiro power)
===============================

The skills vendored in this power are the original work of Matt Pocock.

  Author:  Matt Pocock
  X:       https://x.com/mattpocockuk
  Source:  https://github.com/mattpocock/skills
  License: MIT (see UPSTREAM-LICENSE)

This power repackages those skills UNCHANGED so they can be installed in Kiro.
It is a redistribution (vendoring), not a fork and not original work. No skill
content has been modified. The only structural change is flattening upstream's
skills/engineering/ and skills/productivity/ category folders into skills/<name>/
so the Agent Plugins loader can discover them.

The synced upstream commit is recorded in UPSTREAM.txt.

All credit for the skills belongs to Matt Pocock. Please support the original
author and consult the upstream repository as the source of truth.
